  "changelog": {
    "version": "0.2.9",
    "title": "River Client 0.2.9",
    "summary": "Minecraft 26.3, interface themes, lyrics that follow the singing, Game HUD, and most of what you asked for.",
    "items": [
      "New: Minecraft 26.3.",
      "New: Interface themes. River Dark, River Light, Minecraft Dark and Minecraft Light in the menu's settings, plus a switch for menu animations.",
      "New: Game HUD module. Change the size, background and animation of the boss bar, action bar, tab list and title.",
      "New: To-Do module. Your own task list on screen, ticked off line by line. It can also add what your Litematica schematic still needs.",
      "New: Chat Window module. A movable chat box for your name or chosen words, and those lines marked in the normal chat.",
      "New: Change the version of a mod from its row on the instance page. An older version stays until you change it back.",
      "New: Change an instance's picture. Hover over it on the instance page.",
      "New: Pick your River cape and badge in the launcher, in Wardrobe.",
      "New: Pick your own launcher background in Settings.",
      "New: Lyrics can read YouTube Music and other players in your browser.",
      "New: Lyrics on Linux and Steam Deck. Not tested on a real Deck yet, so tell us how it goes.",
      "Improved: Sky Effects' aurora now goes around the whole sky.",
      "Improved: Many more songs have lyrics timed word by word.",
      "Improved: Stats, Time and other readouts can run in a horizontal line.",
      "Improved: Scoreboard has a background setting and goes up to 150%.",
      "Improved: Newer Fabric Loader for every instance, and you can pick another one on the instance page.",
      "Improved: River's main menu steps aside for Essential, and River's buttons make room for ReplayMod's.",
      "Fixed: Zoom did nothing on Minecraft 26.1.2 and 26.2.",
      "Fixed: Your account could get logged out a few hours into playing, and servers would stop letting you join.",
      "Fixed: The Spotify module stayed blank when the launcher's reader found nothing.",
      "Fixed: The mouse cursor comes back if it goes missing in a menu.",
      "Fixed: Updates failed straight away on some PCs with a \"powershell.exe\" error.",
      "Fixed: Discord and other capture apps could still freeze on the game in full screen.",
      "Fixed: The friends connection could reconnect over and over on slow internet.",
      "Changed: The game's window title starts with Minecraft again, which should let Medal and other clipping apps find it.",
      "Changed: The standalone mod needs a premium Minecraft account."
    ]
  },
  "notes": "Minecraft 26.3, interface themes, lyrics that follow the singing, Game HUD, and most of what you asked for."
}